    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This section outlines the process and activities involved with implementing a new contract. This ensures:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "supplier(s) have all the information they require to plan user’s migration to the new contract",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "users have all the information they require e.g. suppliers’ contact details, information on the goods/services available from the contract",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "continuity of supply",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contract implementation consists of two distinct phases:",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "Migration\tThe movement of organisations to a new contract post \"go-live\".\nMobilisation\tThe process of moving from contract award to \"go-live\" i.e. the point when a user can actually buy from the contract.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "Migration",
            "The movement of organisations to a new contract post \"go-live\"."
          ],
          [
            "Mobilisation",
            "The process of moving from contract award to \"go-live\" i.e. the point when a user can actually buy from the contract."
          ]
        ],
        "row_count": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Note: Some steps in the process may be done at the same time.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The mobilisation process above is a guide to help plan activities between contract award and go live. The timescales for each of the stages should be amended to reflect your own specific procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management throughout this stage of the Journey.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Communication",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Below are the key considerations for communicating the contract. These should be considered in your communications plan (this is intended as a guide rather than being prescriptive:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Why?",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Having completed the procurement to the point of award it is essential that it be correctly communicated. Communication of the contract award and of the subsequent procedures is an important part of ensuring compliance. It also maximises the planned benefit(s) from the procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Who?",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must know who you are targeting with your communications. During strategy development you should have identified all key stakeholders from suppliers to end users. You should consider communications in terms of the three areas below, for each of the identified stakeholder groups.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "What?",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "What?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "What is your communication about? Be clear on and decide your key and supporting messages. Ensure that the subject is appropriate for the correct audience (stakeholder group) and the communication stays focused on the appropriate subject, what they need to know and what is expected of them.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "What?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "When?",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "When?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Plan and consider your communications timings carefully, in line with the implementation process. Your communications must",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "When?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "arrive in good time",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "When?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "allow the audience to understand t the information",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "When?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "allow the audience to then act upon or respond within the timescales.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "When?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Communication should take place at the start, throughout and at the end of the process..",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "When?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "How?",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must consider how you communicate to your audience. This can be determined by the stakeholder audience you are targeting. You may also wish to consider (but not limited to):",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Newsletters – stakeholder community",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Intranet/internet article – public audience",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "e-zines – targeted group",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "e-mail – small targeted group",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Roadshows – specific bidders or the general supplier community",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Accessibility requirements of your audience and accessibility legislation should be considered.",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "How?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Care and Support Services - Communication and Transitional Arrangements",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Why?",
        "Who?",
        "Care and Support Services - Communication and Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Communication with people who use services and their carers",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Having finalised and agreed the procurement plan, an organisation should communicate its intentions to people who use the services and also their carers/representatives. It is important that an organisation provides clear and unambiguous information at this stage and that this information is tailored to the particular audience.",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In these communications an organisation should explain:",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "how long it will take to decide who will provide the service;",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "how long it will take to decide who will provide the service;",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00038",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what will happen at different times in the process;",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00039",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "what will happen at different times in the process;",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00040",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "how people who use the services and their carers will be involved in the process;",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00041",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "how people who use the services and their carers will be involved in the process;",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00042",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "who will make the final decisions and how these will be made;",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "who will make the final decisions and how these will be made;",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "(where appropriate) why there may be a change in service provider; and,",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00045",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "(where appropriate) why there may be a change in service provider; and,",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00046",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "how service provision may change as a result of the procurement process.",
      "ordinal": 46,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00047",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "how service provision may change as a result of the procurement process.",
      "ordinal": 47,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00048",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An organisation should also provide contact details for further information.",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00049",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An organisation should ensure that people who use services and also their carers have help to understand the process and what, if anything, they are being asked about. It should also ensure that these people have sufficient time to consider how they might be affected and to formulate their views before having to respond",
      "ordinal": 49,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Communication with people who use services and their carers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00050",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Transitional Arrangements",
      "ordinal": 50,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00051",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is important that this stage of the procurement process is managed successfully to ensure minimum disruption to people who use services and their carers. This will require close co-operation between different teams within an organisation and between it and service providers.",
      "ordinal": 51,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00052",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This is particularly important where the outcome of the procurement exercise involves the transfer of an existing service to a new service provider. This is because there is some potential for the transfer process to be demanding and consume significant amounts of staff time. An organisation should facilitate the transfer of accurate, up to date information to the new service provider and ensure that the handover arrangements are appropriate and fully implemented.",
      "ordinal": 52,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00053",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Service providers will need to satisfy the Care Inspectorate that it can adhere to the Public Services Reform (Scotland) Act 2010 and Regulations and also meet the relevant National Care Standards. The Care Inspectorate can take up to approximately six months to register a new care service. This depends on a range of issues, including provision of a competent application and the complexity of the service being provided.",
      "ordinal": 53,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00054",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where an existing service provider seeks to deliver a new service under the existing registered care services, this should be discussed with the Care Inspectorate. It may be possible to vary the registration to include the new contract. However, consideration would need to be given to: the current conditions of registration; the size of the service; management and staff support arrangements; geography; client group and needs of those people who use the services; transferability of staff across the service; staff skills and training; and the aims and objectives of the service.",
      "ordinal": 54,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00055",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If a service provider applies to cancel its registration, it is legally required to state whether notice has been given to those people who use the services and their carers about the changes to its service and how their needs will be met if the application to cancel is approved by the Care Inspectorate. An organisation should provide the necessary support and information to a service provider to enable it to meet its legal obligations.",
      "ordinal": 55,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00056",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An organisation which is outsourcing a service or bringing a service back in-house will have to meet its legal obligations under the TUPE Regulations. It should, in all such cases, seek legal advice on application of the TUPE Regulations. In other cases involving the transfer of an existing service, an organisation should consider whether it needs to take any action, for example to facilitate the exchange of information between service providers, should the TUPE Regulations apply.",
      "ordinal": 56,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00057",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
      "ordinal": 57,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00058",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The first meeting with the successful supplier should be held as soon as possible after contract award.",
      "ordinal": 58,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
