        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00063",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "agree timescales.",
      "ordinal": 63,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00064",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must keep in regular contact with the supplier during the contract implementation phase, scheduling additional meetings and communications as required.",
      "ordinal": 64,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00065",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Content Management",
      "ordinal": 65,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Content Management"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00066",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If your commodity/service is deemed catalogue able you should set up the successful tenderer on the Pecos Content Management (PCM) system. This ensures you can prepare the catalogues.",
      "ordinal": 66,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Content Management"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00067",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "PCM will not be appropriate for Care and Support Services.",
      "ordinal": 67,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Content Management"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00068",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The process of content management from start to finish can take weeks. It is mainly dependent on the size (number of line items) and number of catalogues involved. This process involves:",
      "ordinal": 68,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Content Management"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
