    {
      "block_id": "b00096",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This information pack should demonstrate how the contract delivers best value and provides information on contract benefits e.g. savings, KPIs, improvements in quality and service, prompt payment of the full supply chain, sustainable procurement and community benefits expected, etc.",
      "ordinal": 96,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Buyer/End User Information Packs"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00097",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An example of an information pack is provided in the Postal Services End User Guide example below. This is a detailed example. Every information pack must be proportionate to the size and complexity of the procurement, therefore your information pack may be much smaller.",
      "ordinal": 97,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Buyer/End User Information Packs"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00098",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Supplier/Buyer Events",
      "ordinal": 98,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Supplier/Buyer Events"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00099",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A useful way to raise awareness of the contract amongst potential customers is to organise Supplier/Buyer events to give both parties an opportunity to meet each other. An example of the presentation can be found in the Contract Implementation Slides .",
      "ordinal": 99,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Supplier/Buyer Events"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00100",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This is also a good opportunity to distribute information packs/ buyers' guides.",
      "ordinal": 100,
      "heading_path": [
        "Communication",
        "Transitional Arrangements",
        "Post Award Supplier Meeting",
        "Supplier/Buyer Events"
